notes.content:
Hello there! We just released a patch that fixed several issues, including the following:

[list]
[*] [b]Fixed a lot of crashing/optimization issues;[/b]
[*] [b]Matchmaking now takes level disparity into account;[/b] however, keep in mind that matchmaking is not only based on levels but also on MMR!
[*] [b]The following Quests are now fixed and will be working properly: "Show of Strength", "Wind Blessing", "Skeldian Devotion" and "Officer;[/b]
[*] The Kørpijnen shores egg (previously Wavetorn Shores) is now displayed at the proper rarity (Epic);
[*] The Veteran discount will no longer be lost upon purchasing the Starter Pack;
[*] Fixed visual bugs on some armour items;
[*] Fixed display issues on the levelling screen; 
[*] Fixed controller-related issues;
[*] Fixed Phantom's Rage: you will no longer be targetable after activating your rage as Phantom if you just respawned;
[*] Preparations for the Frost and Fury Event are on the way!
[*] [strike]Eduardo[/strike] The Spoils of War carrier received some [strike]manicure[/strike] light adjustments to his model's claws
[/list]

That's all for now! If you haven't found what you were looking for in this list, don't worry - there will be more patches and updates to come, and I'll make sure that your concerns are addressed! 

In the meantime, see you in the skies!
